# Render a GIF of the README demo with VHS (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs):
#   vhs docs/assets/demo.tape
Output docs/assets/demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 600
Type "claude"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "/sdd:init"
Enter
Sleep 8s
Type 'The confirmation email says "bookng". Fix it.'
Enter
Sleep 15s
